  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT PARTLY STALE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096 (analyzer 9.2.0): six-table fixture emits dependency nodes for `[project].dependencies` only; sole arm is toml_config.py L270. poetry's 97 pyproject files: 24 dependency nodes; 157 `[tool.poetry.dependencies]` and 27 `[tool.poetry.group.*.dependencies]` entries have none. The item's to-do on directness, answered: import directness comes from `py_deps.py`, which reads `[project].dependencies`, `[project.optional-dependencies]`, `[tool.poetry.dependencies]` directly; imports declared only in `[dependency-groups]`, a Poetry group or `[tool.poetry.dev-dependencies]` are stamped `undeclared`. `depends_on_manifest` (linkers/dependency.py) exists only for node-backed entries. \"WI-limas\" here means WI-limas-buvin. Spec §14 §3a \"Not recognized\" does not list these tables. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-kagap.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # ad28
