  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. Eleven pyproject tables yield dependency nodes through one list shared by toml_config and py_deps (PEP 621 dependencies and optional-dependencies, PEP 735 dependency-groups, build-system.requires, Poetry dependencies / dev-dependencies / groups, PDM, uv, Hatch). Dependency nodes: poetry 24 -> 178, sqlalchemy 1 -> 85; `undeclared` external symbols on poetry 1,265 -> 1,084. A package in two tables is two nodes with table-scoped stable ids; [project].dependencies stays unscoped; every base node keeps its id and stable id by position (poetry 5,943 of 5,943, sqlalchemy 65,443 of 65,443). linkers/dependency.py keeps one declaration per manifest, runtime first (this also applies to Cargo; no Cargo repository measured). Visible: supply_chain_summary counts declarations, so poetry's direct goes 161 -> 471."  # f09b
